00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:20.900
You can actually create what's
called a logs-based metric

00:17:20.900 --> 00:17:23.150
in logging, which
basically says,

00:17:23.150 --> 00:17:25.460
every time this kind
of log entry happens--

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:28.430
I mean, you can do simple
matching against the log entry.

00:17:28.430 --> 00:17:30.980
You can match on
