00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:34.280
if the log entry contains
these kind of words or phrases

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:36.765
or matches against
this regex, basically

00:17:36.765 --> 00:17:39.200
write a data point as
part of a time series.

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:42.490
And then that time series
that is created from the log--

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:45.000
again, this log-based metric,
