00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:53.840
they are kind of
intimately tied together

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:55.370
in terms of how
you would use them

00:17:55.370 --> 00:17:56.823
as part of a DevOps practice.

00:17:56.823 --> 00:17:59.240
MARK MIRCHANDANI: So somebody
